WEBVTT

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.710
Good luck, eh, Ron?

00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:15.627
BOY 1: Nice hat!BOY 2: Ron, you're a loser.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.107
I'm counting on you, Ron.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.891
I have two Galleons
on Gryffindor, yeah?

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:21.372
GIRL: Looking good, Ron.BOY 3: Loser!

00:00:23.461 --> 00:00:25.115
What's he wearing?

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.560
RON:
So how was it, then?

00:00:36.648 --> 00:00:37.779
How was what?

00:00:37.823 --> 00:00:39.129
Your dinner party?

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.869
Pretty boring, actually.

00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:43.307
Though I think Harry
enjoyed dessert.

00:00:47.311 --> 00:00:50.183
Slughorn's having
a Christmas do, you know.

00:00:50.227 --> 00:00:51.880
And we're meant
to bring someone.

00:00:51.924 --> 00:00:53.578
I expect you'll
be bringing McLaggen.

00:00:53.621 --> 00:00:54.883
He's in the Slug Club, isn't he?

00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:57.538
Actually, I was going
to ask you.

00:00:57.582 --> 00:00:58.800
Really?

00:01:01.499 --> 00:01:04.284
Good luck today, Ron.

00:01:04.328 --> 00:01:06.852
I know you'll be brilliant.

00:01:09.724 --> 00:01:11.161
I'm resigning.

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.598
After today's match,
McLaggen can have my spot.

00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:15.208
HARRY:
Have it your way.

00:01:15.252 --> 00:01:17.950
Juice?Sure.

00:01:17.993 --> 00:01:19.865
Hello, everyone.

00:01:20.953 --> 00:01:22.302
You look dreadful, Ron.

00:01:22.346 --> 00:01:25.827
Is that why you put
something in his cup?

00:01:27.481 --> 00:01:29.788
Is it a tonic?

00:01:32.878 --> 00:01:34.184
HERMIONE:
Liquid luck.

00:01:35.881 --> 00:01:37.665
Don't drink it, Ron.

00:01:44.933 --> 00:01:46.239
You could be expelled for that.

00:01:46.283 --> 00:01:48.154
I don't know what
you're talking about.

00:01:50.722 --> 00:01:52.593
Come on, Harry.
We've got a game to win.

00:01:55.727 --> 00:01:57.207
[♪♪♪]

00:02:15.486 --> 00:02:17.139
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:02:17.183 --> 00:02:19.229
Yes!

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.449
BOY:
Go on, Ron! Do it!

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:56.266
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:58.659
CROWD [CHANTING]:
Weasley! Weasley! Weasley!

00:02:58.703 --> 00:03:00.531
Yes!

00:03:00.574 --> 00:03:04.186
Weasley! Weasley! Weasley!

00:03:07.842 --> 00:03:09.540
Whoo!

00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:12.978
Yes. Whoo!

00:03:14.109 --> 00:03:16.808
Weasley! Weasley! Weasley!

00:03:16.851 --> 00:03:19.506
Weasley! Weasley! Weasley!

00:03:23.641 --> 00:03:25.469
You really shouldn't
have done it.

00:03:25.512 --> 00:03:30.474
I know. I suppose I could have
just used a Confundus Charm.

00:03:31.605 --> 00:03:34.216
That was different.
That was tryouts.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.306
This was an actual game.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.788
You didn't put it in.

00:03:42.399 --> 00:03:44.314
Ron only thought you did.

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:49.319
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:04:08.729 --> 00:04:11.645
[HERMIONE SNIFFLING]

00:04:13.255 --> 00:04:14.605
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

00:04:32.013 --> 00:04:35.408
Charms spell.
I'm just practicing.

00:04:39.238 --> 00:04:41.240
Well, they're really good.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.726
How does it feel, Harry...

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:54.732
when you see Dean with Ginny?

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:59.650
Oh, um--

00:04:59.693 --> 00:05:01.303
I know.

00:05:02.261 --> 00:05:05.090
I see the way you look at her.

00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:06.918
You're my best friend.

00:05:09.181 --> 00:05:10.835
[LAVENDER LAUGHING]

00:05:16.362 --> 00:05:17.798
Oops.

00:05:19.104 --> 00:05:21.454
I think this room's taken.

00:05:23.108 --> 00:05:24.675
What's with the birds?

00:05:27.895 --> 00:05:29.723
Oppugno.

00:05:49.874 --> 00:05:51.789
[SOBBING]

00:05:57.621 --> 00:05:59.449
It feels like this.

